{% comment %}
  Renders one line of the formula panel's code block.

  Merchants write plain text; two markdown-style markers add the syntax
  colour, so nobody has to type HTML into a theme setting:

    `backticks`  -> value / variable colour
    ~tildes~     -> function colour

  Both are parsed by splitting on the marker and colouring the odd-indexed
  parts, the same trick markdown uses for inline code. A line whose style is
  "comment" is coloured whole and the markers are left alone.

  Text is escaped after splitting, so a formula can safely contain < and >.

  Whitespace control is deliberate and tight throughout: the container sets
  white-space: pre to keep the demo's column alignment, so any stray newline
  from Liquid would show up on the page.

  Markup only; styling lives in sections/custom-formula-panel.liquid.

  Accepts:
  - text:  {String} the line
  - style: {String} 'code' | 'comment' | 'blank'
  - attrs: {String} block.shopify_attributes

  Usage:
  {% render 'custom-formula-line', text: block.settings.text, style: block.settings.style %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- if style == 'blank' -%}
  <code class="--fm-line --is-blank" aria-hidden="true" {{ attrs }}>&nbsp;</code>
{%- elsif style == 'comment' -%}
  <code class="--fm-line --is-comment" {{ attrs }}>{{ text | escape }}</code>
{%- else -%}
  <code class="--fm-line" {{ attrs }}>
    {%- assign value_parts = text | split: '`' -%}
    {%- for value_part in value_parts -%}
      {%- assign is_value = forloop.index0 | modulo: 2 -%}
      {%- if is_value == 1 -%}
        <span class="--fm-value">{{ value_part | escape }}</span>
      {%- else -%}
        {%- assign fn_parts = value_part | split: '~' -%}
        {%- for fn_part in fn_parts -%}
          {%- assign is_fn = forloop.index0 | modulo: 2 -%}
          {%- if is_fn == 1 -%}
            <span class="--fm-fn">{{ fn_part | escape }}</span>
          {%- else -%}
            {{- fn_part | escape -}}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </code>
{%- endif -%}
